# Didit MCP guidance

- The global `user-didit` MCP server is installed and authenticated at `https://mcp.didit.me/mcp`.
- For Didit implementation, configuration, schema, workflow, webhook, or operational questions, inspect the relevant live Didit MCP tools and schemas proactively.
- Use MCP evidence alongside current official Didit documentation and the repository's existing contracts; do not rely only on memory.
- Discover the exact MCP tool schema with `GetMcpTools` before every `CallMcpTool` invocation.
- Prefer read-only MCP operations unless the requested task explicitly requires a remote Didit mutation.
